  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A net force <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span> acts on an object of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> that is initially at rest. The object moves in a straight line. The variation of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span> with the distance <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"s\"></span> is shown.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the speed of the object at the distance <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"s_{1}\"></span>?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{F_{1}s_{1}}{2m}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{F_{1}s_{1}}{m}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{2F_{1}s_{1}}{m}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{4F_{1}s_{1}}{m}}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
